note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/nvidia/checks/gemm_policy.om: the Omega port of CUDApp tests/gemm_ex_policy_test.c. Composed after
note gpu/nvidia/om/gemmex/policy.om and gpu/nvidia/checks/lib.om; run with gpu/nvidia/checks/gemm_policy.tsv, whose
note expected values the retained C host policy (gx_min, gx_arow, gx_bcol, gx_brow, gx_pack of
note src/omega_gpu_gemm_ex.c with CUDAPP_MIGRATION_PENDING_C_GEMM_EX_HOST_POLICY) and the test's own formulas for
note ops 4, 5 and 6 wrote over the old differential's whole domain, each distinct case once.
note Case: OP A B C D WANT. gemm_ex_policy OP A B C D must return WANT.
text t_name "GEMM_POLICY"
fn cname to void
for i ulong len t_name bound 64
ckoc ulong get t_name i
end
end
fn crow to bool
if ne ckcnt 6
ckbad
end
ret eq gemm_ex_policy cknum 0 cknum 1 cknum 2 cknum 3 cknum 4 cknum 5
end
